data: {"level":2,"reviewed":{"level":2,"label":"formula / approach","text":"Sort by score, descending. Group the equal scores into runs. A run that occupies positions a..b\ncontributes its mean relevance times the sum of the discounts 1 / log2(r + 1) for r in a..b, counting\nonly r within k. Prefix sums of the discounts make each run cost O(1). IDCG is the same sum over the\nrelevance sorted descending. If IDCG is 0, return 0.0."},"hints_note":null}

